      "Replication": "Auto",
      "Description": "Finaliza a transação atual do Dynamo, retornando seja o que lhe foi passado. .\n\nTransaction.End (input: var): var[]..[]"
    },
    {
      "ConcreteType": "PythonNodeModels.PythonNode, PythonNodeModels",
      "NodeType": "PythonScriptNode",
      "Code": "# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\r\n\r\ninput_list = IN[0]\r\n\r\ndef process_string(s):\r\n    # Se for None ou a string literal \"null\", mantém \"null\"\r\n    if s is None or (isinstance(s, basestring) and s.strip().lower() == \"null\"):\r\n        return \"null\"\r\n    # converte para minúsculas pra comparar\r\n    s_lower = s.lower()\r\n    if \"madeira\" in s_lower:\r\n        return \"MADEIRA\"\r\n    elif \"metal\" in s_lower or \"aluminio\" in s_lower:\r\n        return \"METAL\"\r\n    else:\r\n        return \"PINTURA BRANCA\"\r\n\r\nOUT = [process_string(item) for item in input_list]\r\n",
      "Engine": "IronPython2",
      "EngineName": "IronPython2",
      "VariableInputPorts": true,
      "Id": "7ca601c13df542e0aaf4dbd2b8c817df",
      "Inputs": [
